Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Kiali Dashboard Not Accessible
Symptoms: Cannot access Kiali at localhost:20001

Solutions:

# Check if port-forward is running
ps aux | grep "kubectl port-forward"

# Restart port-forward
kubectl port-forward svc/kiali 20001:20001 -n istio-system --address 0.0.0.0

# Check Kiali pod status
kubectl get pods -n istio-system | grep kiali
Issue 2: No Traffic Visible in Graph
Symptoms: Empty graph or no traffic edges

Solutions:

# Verify application pods are running
kubectl get pods -n bookinfo

# Check if traffic generation is working
curl -I http://localhost/productpage

# Verify Istio proxy injection
kubectl get pods -n bookinfo -o jsonpath='{.items[*].spec.containers[*].name}'
Issue 3: Services Not Showing Metrics
Symptoms: Missing metrics in service details

Solutions:

# Check Prometheus connectivity
kubectl get svc -n istio-system | grep prometheus

# Verify telemetry configuration
kubectl get telemetry -A
